  "卫星只看见影子扫过地球。中央金边深核是本影——站在那里看见日全食；周围品红圈是半影，那里只是日偏食。": "A satellite only sees the shadow sweep across Earth. The gold-rimmed dark core is the umbra—stand there and you see a total solar eclipse; the magenta ring around it is the penumbra, where it is only partial.",
